<title>SPAIN: Obrascon says to merge with Huarte.</title>
<headline>Obrascon says to merge with Huarte.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish construction firms Huarte and Obrascon are to merge after the former firm completes a financial overhaul, Juan Miguel Villar Mir, chairman of Obrascon's holding company Inmobiliaria Espacio said on Monday.  </p>
<p>&quot;If Huarte's assets and affiliates are well-liquidated in 1997, at the end of the year we can get on with the merger,&quot; Villar Mir told a press conference.</p>
<p>Last week, Inmobiliaria Espacio bought the rights to purchase 24.9 percent of Huarte's capital.</p>
<p>Huarte has been in suspension of payments since March 15.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
